/** @page about About
  @section doc Multiplierless FIR Filter Design

  This project designs multiplierless FIR lowpass filters with the ellipsoid
  method. It quantizes the impulse response to Canonical Signed Digit (CSD)
  form and can emit synthesizable transpose- or direct-form Verilog.

  The public headers are under `include/multiplierless/`; the FIR design CLI
  lives in `standalone/source/fir_design.cpp`.
*/
